# Tenant data must never be baked into the image. The brand-analytics directory
# holds per-org CSV uploads (and, on a developer machine, real customer reports).
# Shipping it would put one tenant's data on every deployment — see
# resolveDataDir() in src/services/brand-analytics/loader.js.
#
# data/keepa and data/public-stats ARE read at runtime and are intentionally
# not excluded. The upload route creates data/brand-analytics/<orgId>/ with
# mkdir recursive, so the missing directory is fine.
data/brand-analytics/

# Dependencies are installed inside the image; copying host copies both bloats
# the build context and can clobber the platform-correct binaries.
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/build/

# Never ship secrets or local scan output
.env
.env.*
snyk-report.json
snyk-report.sarif
snyk-mediums.json
snyk-mediums.txt

.git/
.github/
coverage/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
